{"id":"n77121-1-7","stage":4,"title":"주택가 · 住宅区","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77121-1-7-1","ko":"저희 가게가 주택가에 있어서 찾기 어려우실 거예요.","zh":"我们的店在住宅区，您可能会很难找到的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们。","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}},{"text":"가게가","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게가","audio":"/audio/d93ad8ca691832ed80c0.mp3"}},{"text":"주택가에","meaning":"住宅区","explanation":"주택가：住宅区；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주택가","audio":"/audio/9693f550513cfb1eee45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77121","senseId":"1","lemma":"주택가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주택가에","audio":"/audio/dd9664f9c438a635e0e0.mp3"}},{"text":"있어서","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어서","audio":"/audio/8c518243ad11245b602e.mp3"}},{"text":"찾기","meaning":"拜访，寻访，探访","explanation":"찾다：拜访，寻访，探访；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"5","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾기","audio":"/audio/832f7474f0cc68b70c2e.mp3"}},{"text":"어려우실","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어려우실","audio":"/audio/acc0b09d787727b90df4.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"9693f550513cfb1e","term":"주택가","zh":"住宅区","audio":"/audio/9693f550513cfb1eee45.mp3","entryId":"77121","definition":"聚集居住房屋的地段。","pronunciation":["주ː택까"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"拜访，寻访，探访","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了见某人或看某地而去相关场所。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/52d6e1b21b2c4e237650.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77121-1-7-2","ko":"가게를 못 찾겠으면 전화 드릴게요.","zh":"要是找不到店的话，我会打电话给您的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가게를","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"ter